			"notes": "## Which jar do I download?\n\n| Your server version | Download the jar ending in |\n|---|---|\n| Minecraft 26.2 | `-mc26.2.jar` |\n| Minecraft 26.1.x | `-mc26.1.jar` |\n| Minecraft 1.21.11 and below | `-mc1.21.11.jar` |\n\nThere is one jar per Minecraft generation and they are **not**\ninterchangeable. Installing the wrong one fails at startup with\n`Unsupported API version` in the console, or\n`UnsupportedClassVersionError` on a Java 21 server, and the plugin\nnever loads. Check the suffix against the table before restarting.\n\nPaper, Purpur and other Paper forks use the same jar.\n\n---\n\nBuilt by GitHub Actions from d949c1c3d2f5efa1e0fda77d13d6d0bf6e9ca616.\n\nVerify what you downloaded matches what was built from this source:\n\n```\nsha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.txt\n```\n\nBuild log: https://github.com/creeperdiamonds/strikerload/actions/runs/34888475201\n\nLicensed AGPL-3.0-or-later."
